WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.666 --> 00:00:30.625
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:30.625 --> 00:00:34.875
spoke of ‘Abhyasa-yoga’ related to devotion.

3
00:00:34.875 --> 00:00:38.875
Where through regular small acts of devotion,

4
00:00:38.875 --> 00:00:43.375
we learn to fix our mind in Lord Krishna.

5
00:00:43.375 --> 00:00:46.750
But the mind is still restless.

6
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:49.250
So those who find even fixing the mind through

7
00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:53.166
abhyasa yoga difficult,
what should those people do?

8
00:00:53.166 --> 00:00:56.750
Who understands us better than Lord Krishna?

9
00:00:56.750 --> 00:00:58.958
So for such a situation too,

10
00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:05.250
He reveals yet another level of
devotion in a very practical way.

11
00:01:09.833 --> 00:01:12.166
Lord Krishna tells Arjuna,

12
00:01:12.166 --> 00:01:13.958
if you are unable to remember Me or practise

13
00:01:13.958 --> 00:01:16.958
bhakti yoga,

14
00:01:16.958 --> 00:01:18.333
that is all right.

15
00:01:18.333 --> 00:01:22.041
Simply dedicate yourself to me.

16
00:01:22.041 --> 00:01:23.916
Even by acting for Me,

17
00:01:23.916 --> 00:01:26.166
you will attain perfection.

18
00:01:26.166 --> 00:01:28.500
For every person, to continuously meditate

19
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:29.458
on Lord Krishna,

20
00:01:29.458 --> 00:01:33.083
or regularly engage in
devotion-related bhajan or kirtan

21
00:01:33.083 --> 00:01:36.583
or rituals, may perhaps not be possible.

22
00:01:36.583 --> 00:01:38.250
But this does not mean

23
00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:40.791
that the path of devotion has closed.

24
00:01:40.791 --> 00:01:43.333
If we act for Lord Krishna,

25
00:01:43.333 --> 00:01:47.708
this too will carry us forward on
the path of devotion.

26
00:01:47.708 --> 00:01:48.750
But now

27
00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:51.375
the question arises – how does one act

28
00:01:51.375 --> 00:01:53.000
for Lord Krishna?

29
00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.250
When someone serves in temples,

30
00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:58.375
or spreads spiritual knowledge to people,

31
00:01:58.375 --> 00:02:00.625
organises bhajan and kirtan,

32
00:02:00.625 --> 00:02:03.000
or helps those people

33
00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:05.750
who are spreading the Lord's message.

34
00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:09.416
All of this is action done for Lord Krishna.

35
00:02:09.416 --> 00:02:12.291
Lord Krishna gives this assurance that if

36
00:02:12.291 --> 00:02:13.291
someone with sincerity

37
00:02:13.291 --> 00:02:15.833
and faith acts for Him,

38
00:02:15.833 --> 00:02:17.541
then gradually that person

39
00:02:17.541 --> 00:02:20.666
begins to move toward perfection in devotion.

40
00:02:20.666 --> 00:02:23.125
Just as a small child learns to walk,

41
00:02:23.125 --> 00:02:24.375
falls sometimes,

42
00:02:24.375 --> 00:02:25.625
steadies sometimes,

43
00:02:25.625 --> 00:02:26.750
but does not stop,

44
00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:28.416
and because of this progress, one day

45
00:02:28.416 --> 00:02:29.875
they begin to walk.

46
00:02:29.875 --> 00:02:33.000
In the same way, one who acts for Lord Krishna,

47
00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.125
their progress too keeps going,

48
00:02:35.125 --> 00:02:40.625
and gradually their connection
with Lord Krishna deepens.

49
00:02:40.625 --> 00:02:42.833
The message of this verse is clear.

50
00:02:42.833 --> 00:02:45.958
If you feel that you are not ready,

51
00:02:45.958 --> 00:02:50.250
for deep meditation or spiritual
discipline and practice,

52
00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:51.791
then do not worry.

53
00:02:51.791 --> 00:02:54.333
Simply dedicate your work and

54
00:02:54.333 --> 00:02:57.916
effort to the service of Lord Krishna.

55
00:02:57.916 --> 00:02:59.541
This will gradually carry you

56
00:02:59.541 --> 00:03:02.791
toward a higher level of devotion.

57
00:03:02.791 --> 00:03:04.958
The essence of this verse is this,

58
00:03:04.958 --> 00:03:08.666
action done for Lord Krishna with
the right feeling

59
00:03:08.666 --> 00:03:14.041
is also a great step taken on
the path of devotion.

60
00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:21.166
If you are not able to surrender your mind

61
00:03:21.166 --> 00:03:24.000
completely to me,

62
00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:26.500
then there is nothing to worry about.

63
00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:31.916
It may be that your faith is not yet fully firm,

64
00:03:31.916 --> 00:03:36.083
or it may be that in the rush of life

65
00:03:36.083 --> 00:03:40.583
you do not find time for regular
practice of devotion.

66
00:03:40.583 --> 00:03:44.333
In such a case, do not be disheartened at all.

67
00:03:44.333 --> 00:03:47.083
If surrendering the whole mind

68
00:03:47.083 --> 00:03:50.000
feels difficult,

69
00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:55.583
then offer whatever is within you –

70
00:03:55.583 --> 00:03:59.833
That is, your arts, your abilities.

71
00:03:59.833 --> 00:04:04.250
the work in which you are skilled.

72
00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:08.583
Put these toward a higher purpose.

73
00:04:08.583 --> 00:04:11.583
In all of these, find that feeling

74
00:04:11.583 --> 00:04:15.208
by which you are helping others.

75
00:04:15.208 --> 00:04:20.250
contributing a service to society.

76
00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:21.708
If

77
00:04:21.708 --> 00:04:24.000
this world is Mine,

78
00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:26.875
the people present here are Mine,

79
00:04:26.875 --> 00:04:30.000
then making their lives easier is also

80
00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.125
My work.

81
00:04:32.125 --> 00:04:34.708
Which is what you are doing.

82
00:04:34.708 --> 00:04:37.041
Simply from this very feeling

83
00:04:37.041 --> 00:04:40.125
the seed of devotion will sprout.

84
00:04:40.125 --> 00:04:43.958
Many people think that spirituality means

85
00:04:43.958 --> 00:04:47.541
giving up everything,

86
00:04:47.541 --> 00:04:50.333
but it is not so.

87
00:04:50.333 --> 00:04:54.833
Begin right where you are,

88
00:04:54.833 --> 00:04:58.791
just as you are, doing what you can.

89
00:04:58.791 --> 00:05:01.958
Just as I told Arjuna

90
00:05:01.958 --> 00:05:05.500
that if the mind does not fix in Me, then

91
00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:09.000
act for Me, in the same way

92
00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:12.208
you too dedicate your work
to the higher purpose

93
00:05:12.208 --> 00:05:18.208
of humanity or devotion.

94
00:05:18.208 --> 00:05:23.000
This small beginning will
purify your consciousness

95
00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:26.916
and gradually bring you to Me.

96
00:05:26.916 --> 00:05:29.500
This path is very simple.

97
00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:33.083
No great change is needed.

98
00:05:33.083 --> 00:05:35.291
The work is the same,

99
00:05:35.291 --> 00:05:38.250
just begin to hold a new feeling within it.

100
00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:40.125
Now tell me -

101
00:05:40.125 --> 00:05:43.083
can you not walk on this path now?

102
00:05:43.083 --> 00:05:46.833
There is no obstacle left.

103
00:05:51.625 --> 00:05:54.416
Whether it is about learning and study,

104
00:05:54.416 --> 00:06:00.500
work ability, or understanding
life's responsibilities

105
00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:02.791
All the people of a family,

106
00:06:02.791 --> 00:06:06.833
in these matters, will be found at different levels.

107
00:06:06.833 --> 00:06:10.041
People are different, so differences will exist too.

108
00:06:10.041 --> 00:06:11.833
This is entirely natural.

109
00:06:11.833 --> 00:06:14.375
Just as some children

110
00:06:14.375 --> 00:06:17.541
understand all things quickly,

111
00:06:17.541 --> 00:06:20.083
while some need more time

112
00:06:20.083 --> 00:06:23.541
and guidance.

113
00:06:23.541 --> 00:06:27.166
In such a case, it is the duty of elders

114
00:06:27.166 --> 00:06:30.750
not to discourage the younger ones

115
00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:33.291
by comparing them with others,

116
00:06:33.291 --> 00:06:39.625
but to help them gradually raise their level.

117
00:06:39.625 --> 00:06:42.041
You are all different.

118
00:06:42.041 --> 00:06:45.208
Different feelings, different perspectives.

119
00:06:45.208 --> 00:06:47.916
That is precisely why I too,

120
00:06:47.916 --> 00:06:51.958
have described different levels of devotion

121
00:06:51.958 --> 00:06:56.750
suited to each person and their capacity.

122
00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:58.041
If a child

123
00:06:58.041 --> 00:07:01.125
faces difficulty in studies,

124
00:07:01.125 --> 00:07:04.416
then instead of putting unnecessary pressure,

125
00:07:04.416 --> 00:07:08.750
making a plan to help them will be more fitting.

126
00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:13.500
A plan where they receive the help of a tutor

127
00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:17.375
in difficult subjects,

128
00:07:17.375 --> 00:07:19.833
where examples and activities are used

129
00:07:19.833 --> 00:07:24.958
to help them understand concepts,

130
00:07:24.958 --> 00:07:28.708
and where studies are made interesting.

131
00:07:28.708 --> 00:07:32.250
Unnecessary pressure will discourage,

132
00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:33.291
and on the other hand,

133
00:07:33.291 --> 00:07:36.750
all these approaches will
awaken interest in studies.

134
00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:38.958
Similarly,

135
00:07:38.958 --> 00:07:41.541
if a family member

136
00:07:41.541 --> 00:07:44.958
shows no inclination toward spirituality,

137
00:07:44.958 --> 00:07:49.916
it would be unfair to expect
deep devotion from them.

138
00:07:49.916 --> 00:07:53.333
Instead, involve them in small

139
00:07:53.333 --> 00:07:58.583
but meaningful activities –

140
00:07:58.583 --> 00:08:01.791
Discussion on aspects of spirituality.

141
00:08:01.791 --> 00:08:05.250
Taking them along to a temple or satsang.

142
00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:10.583
contributing together to community service.

143
00:08:10.583 --> 00:08:15.208
All of this will awaken an
interest in spirituality in them.

144
00:08:15.208 --> 00:08:18.625
Every person has their own journey.

145
00:08:18.625 --> 00:08:19.666
When you

146
00:08:19.666 --> 00:08:24.000
help them according to their nature,

147
00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:30.958
people move forward with ease and confidence.

148
00:08:30.958 --> 00:08:33.666
In devotion too it is like this.

149
00:08:33.666 --> 00:08:38.541
I love everyone,

150
00:08:38.541 --> 00:08:43.291
and so there is a suitable path
for everyone to reach Me.

151
00:08:43.291 --> 00:08:47.708
In the same way, in the family too -
guide others not with pressure,

152
00:08:47.708 --> 00:08:52.875
but with love and patience.

153
00:08:57.541 --> 00:09:02.166
In an organisation, many people work together.

154
00:09:02.166 --> 00:09:05.750
And it is natural that the level of knowledge,

155
00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:07.375
confidence, or experience

156
00:09:07.375 --> 00:09:11.125
will not be the same in everyone.

157
00:09:11.125 --> 00:09:14.833
If you are in a leadership position,

158
00:09:14.833 --> 00:09:17.000
then it is your responsibility

159
00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:19.916
that you understand these differences

160
00:09:19.916 --> 00:09:23.666
and give every person an opportunity to grow

161
00:09:23.666 --> 00:09:26.333
according to thier ability.

162
00:09:26.333 --> 00:09:28.708
Just as I told Arjuna

163
00:09:28.708 --> 00:09:33.166
that there are different levels of devotion –

164
00:09:33.166 --> 00:09:35.708
fixing the mind on Me,

165
00:09:35.708 --> 00:09:37.791
abhyasa yoga for devotion,

166
00:09:37.791 --> 00:09:42.166
or dedicating one’s actions to Me.

167
00:09:42.166 --> 00:09:44.125
According to everyone's personality

168
00:09:44.125 --> 00:09:48.708
and situation, there are different suggestions.

169
00:09:48.708 --> 00:09:52.791
In the same way, the members of
your organisation

170
00:09:52.791 --> 00:09:56.375
are each capable of contributing their best

171
00:09:56.375 --> 00:09:58.083
in their own way.

172
00:09:58.083 --> 00:10:03.208
Belittling someone by comparing
them with others

173
00:10:03.208 --> 00:10:06.500
only discourages.

174
00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:09.500
The work of an organisation's senior officers

175
00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:13.291
is not to discourage; their work is to

176
00:10:13.291 --> 00:10:15.333
encourage people

177
00:10:15.333 --> 00:10:20.375
to contribute their best according to their skills.

178
00:10:20.375 --> 00:10:24.458
The right approach is to understand people,

179
00:10:24.458 --> 00:10:30.000
give them responsibilities they can fulfil.

180
00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:34.041
In this way, by building confidence,

181
00:10:34.041 --> 00:10:38.041
give people gradually larger responsibilities.

182
00:10:38.041 --> 00:10:40.458
This way people will progress,

183
00:10:40.458 --> 00:10:43.375
their confidence will grow,

184
00:10:43.375 --> 00:10:48.583
and they will emerge as capable professionals.

185
00:10:48.583 --> 00:10:50.291
Just as

186
00:10:50.291 --> 00:10:56.750
I help everyone progress in their devotion –

187
00:10:56.750 --> 00:10:58.833
in the same way, you too

188
00:10:58.833 --> 00:11:04.250
be a support for the progress of
those who work with you,

189
00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:07.583
with patience and empathy.
